{"ptb_xl": "PTB-XL is a large, publicly available dataset of 12-lead electrocardiogram (ECG) recordings from 18,885 patients, widely used for benchmarking and developing machine learning algorithms in cardiology. It features 21,837 records with comprehensive annotations and metadata, hierarchical diagnostic labels, and extensive ECG recordings. This dataset is a crucial resource for researchers and clinicians, supporting various deep learning studies and the development of diagnostic tools for heart conditions."},
{"ptb_xl__provides__benchmarks_and_insights": "The term \"provides\" in this context signifies the action of supplying or offering something valuable. In the case of PTB-XL, it indicates that the database offers essential resources, specifically benchmarks and insights, to the field of ECG analysis."},
