{"ieee_journal_of_biomedical_and_health_informatics": "The IEEE Journal of Biomedical and Health Informatics is a peer-reviewed scientific journal dedicated to the application of information technology in healthcare, biomedical research, and the intersection of biomedical engineering, health informatics, and information technology. It publishes original research articles, reviews, case studies, editorials, and special issues on topics such as electronic health records, telemedicine, bioinformatics, medical imaging, and health data analytics to advance the field of biomedical and health informatics."},
