{"normal_ecg": "The object \"normal ECG\" refers to an electrocardiogram that shows no signs of abnormalities or pathological conditions, indicating a healthy heart rhythm and function as per standard medical criteria.|Here is another description: Normal ECG refers to an electrocardiogram that shows no abnormalities or deviations from the standard patterns, indicating a healthy heart rhythm and function."},
