{"left_bundle_branch_block": "Left bundle branch block (LBBB) is a condition where there is a delay or obstruction along the pathway that electrical impulses travel to make the heart beat. This can affect the heart's ability to pump blood efficiently and is often identified through an electrocardiogram (ECG)."},
