{"deep_learning_approaches__are_covered_in__recent_excellent_reviews_22_24": "The phrase \"are covered in\" indicates that the subject, deep learning approaches, is discussed or reviewed within the specified object, which in this case are recent, excellent reviews. This predicate signifies that the subject is a topic of detailed examination and discussion in the given reviews."},
