{"inceptiontime": "InceptionTime is a specific convolutional neural network architecture designed for time series classification. It is based on the Inception model, which is known for its efficiency and effectiveness in image classification tasks, and has been adapted for the temporal domain to handle time series data. InceptionTime incorporates multiple parallel convolutional filters of different sizes to capture various temporal patterns within the data."},
{"inception1d": "_inception1d_ is a specialized version of the inception architecture tailored for time series data. It is part of a suite of implementations that closely follow the original publications and reference implementations of various architectures.|Here is another description: _inception1d_ is a type of model architecture used in the context of predicting sex from ECG data. It is noted for its performance alongside other architectures like _xresnet1d101_ and _lstm_bidir_."},
