{"observations": "The observations refer to the results and findings obtained from the implementation of the concat-pooling layer and the slight enlargement of kernel sizes in the resnets within the context of adapting the inception architecture to the time series domain.|Here is another description: The observations refer to the results obtained from the age regression experiment, particularly noting the better performance when testing only on normal subjects compared to abnormal or all subjects."},
