{"original_time_series_data": "Original time series data refers to raw, unprocessed sequences of data points collected over time. These datasets are crucial for training models as they provide the true, unaltered patterns and trends that the models need to learn in order to make accurate predictions or classifications."},
{"deep_learning_models__without__further_preprocessing_such_as_removing_baseline_wander_and_or_filtering": "The predicate \"without\" indicates that the deep learning models were trained under certain conditions or constraints. Specifically, it highlights that the models were trained without the inclusion of additional preprocessing steps."},
