{"two_classifiers": "The two classifiers are machine learning models evaluated in the context of the ICBEB2018 dataset, used for the PhysioNet/CinC challenge 2020. These classifiers are assessed using performance metrics like macro-averaged _F\u03b2_ -score and _G\u03b2_ -score, with _\u03b2_ = 2."},
