{"resnetarchitectures": "Resnetarchitectures refer to a family of deep learning models known as Residual Networks, which are characterized by their use of skip connections to facilitate the training of deeper networks. These architectures have been widely adopted in various domains due to their ability to achieve high performance in complex tasks."},
