{"inception_based_architectures": "Inception-based architectures are a type of modern convolutional neural network architecture that incorporates skip-connections, allowing for deeper and more performant models compared to standard feed-forward convolutional architectures. They are known for their effectiveness in various applications, including time series classification."},
