{"a_pretraining_resource_for_generic_ecg_classifiers": "A pretraining resource for generic ECG classifiers refers to a dataset that is used to initially train machine learning models before they are fine-tuned for specific ECG classification tasks, similar to how ImageNet is used in computer vision."},
