{"ecg_records": "The subject entity, ECG records, refers to a collection of 21,837 clinical 12-lead electrocardiogram records from 18,885 patients. These records are part of a dataset that is notable for its size and the richness of its annotations, making it a valuable resource for machine learning applications in cardiology.|Here is another description: The ECG records refer to a collection of 21837 clinical 12-lead electrocardiogram records, each of 10 seconds duration, which are part of a large dataset used for medical analysis and machine learning applications."},
