{"diag_form_rhythm": "The objects _diag_, _form_, and _rhythm_ represent specific types of ECG annotations. _diag_ stands for diagnostic statements, _form_ relates to changes in particular ECG segments, and _rhythm_ pertains to changes in the heart's rhythm. These categories are used to annotate the clinical ECG records in the dataset."},
