{"rhythm__related_to__particular_changes_of_the_rhythm": "The predicate, related to, indicates an association or connection between the subject category _rhythm_ and specific changes observed in the rhythm of the ECG. This relation helps in categorizing and understanding the types of rhythm anomalies present in the ECG records."},
