{"icbeb2018_dataset__based_on__data_released_for_the_1st_china_physiological_signal_challenge_2018": "The phrase \"based on\" indicates that the ICBEB2018 dataset is derived from or constructed using the data that was originally released for a specific event or challenge, in this case, the 1st China Physiological Signal Challenge 2018."},
{"data_released_for_the_1st_china_physiological_signal_challenge_2018": "The data released for the 1st China Physiological Signal Challenge 2018 is a set of physiological signals, specifically ECGs, that were made available for the challenge held during the 7th International Conference on Biomedical Engineering and Biotechnology (ICBEB 2018)."},
