{"7th_international_conference_on_biomedical_engineering_and_biotechnology_icbeb_2018": "The 7th International Conference on Biomedical Engineering and Biotechnology (ICBEB 2018) was a significant academic conference that brought together researchers, scientists, and professionals in the fields of biomedical engineering and biotechnology. The conference provided a platform for the presentation of recent advances, discussions on emerging trends, and the sharing of innovative research and technologies in these fields."},
