{"6877_12_lead_ecgs": "The object \"6877 12-lead ECGs\" refers to the total number of electrocardiogram records included in the ICBEB2018 dataset. These ECGs are lasting between 6 and 60 seconds and are annotated by up to three statements by up to three reviewers from a set of nine classes."},
