{"commonly_used_in_literature_approaches": "Literature approaches refer to the methods and techniques described and utilized in academic and research publications. In this context, these approaches commonly incorporate preprocessing steps like removing baseline wander and filtering to enhance the performance of models analyzing time series data."},
