{"experiments__serve__two_purposes": "The predicate \"serve\" indicates that the experiments have a dual function or role. They are intended to achieve two distinct objectives or outcomes through their execution."},
{"two_purposes": "The two purposes of the experiments are to provide initial benchmarking results for future reference and to illustrate the versatility of analyses that can be performed using the PTB-XL dataset. This means the experiments aim to set a standard for comparison in future studies and showcase the broad range of applications and insights that can be derived from the dataset."},
