{"section_iii_c__investigates__aspects_of_transfer_learning_using_ptb_xl_for_pretraining": "The predicate 'investigates' signifies a thorough examination or study of a particular topic or methodology. In this context, it refers to the detailed exploration of transfer learning techniques using the PTB-XL dataset for pretraining purposes."},
{"aspects_of_transfer_learning_using_ptb_xl_for_pretraining": "Aspects of transfer learning using PTB-XL for pretraining refer to the various elements or components of transfer learning that are being studied or applied using the PTB-XL dataset as a foundation for pretraining models. This includes understanding how pretraining on PTB-XL can enhance the performance of models when applied to different tasks or datasets."},
