{"bootstrap_process__does_not_guarantee__that_at_least_one_positive_sample_for_each_class_is_contained_in_each_bootstrap_sample": "The predicate \"does not guarantee\" indicates that the bootstrap process lacks a certain assurance. Specifically, it highlights that there is no certainty that a particular condition will be met during the bootstrap sampling, which in this case is the inclusion of at least one positive sample for each class in every bootstrap sample."},
