{"metrics_such_as_the_term_centric_macro_auc": "Metrics such as the term-centric macro-AUC are performance evaluation measures used to assess the effectiveness of classification algorithms, particularly in multi-class or multi-label scenarios. These metrics provide a comprehensive view of the classifier's performance across different classes by averaging the Area Under the Curve (AUC) for each term or class."},
