{"if_at_least_one_positive_sample_for_each_class_is_not_contained_in_each_bootstrap_sample": "The condition \"if at least one positive sample for each class is not contained in each bootstrap sample\" describes a scenario where the bootstrap sample\u2014a random sample used in statistical methods like bootstrapping\u2014lacks the necessary data points for accurate metric calculation. Specifically, it requires that each class must have at least one positive sample represented in the bootstrap sample to ensure valid evaluation of metrics like the term-centric macro-AUC."},
