{"bootstrap_samples__are_discarded_and_redrawn_until__at_least_one_positive_sample_for_each_class_is_found": "The phrase \"are discarded and redrawn until\" describes the process of rejecting bootstrap samples that do not meet a specific criterion and then drawing new samples until the criterion is satisfied. This ensures that the bootstrap samples are suitable for evaluating certain metrics."},
