{"ecg_statements__stand_out_from__other_members_of_the_same_subclass": "The phrase \"stand out from\" indicates a notable difference or distinction in performance or characteristics when compared to a reference group. In this context, it suggests that certain ECG statements exhibit unique or exceptional features that set them apart."},
