{"cdc__published__national_ambulatory_medical_care_survey_2016_national_summary_tables": "The predicate \"published\" indicates that the CDC has made available or released a specific document or report. This action involves disseminating information to the public or relevant stakeholders."},
{"national_ambulatory_medical_care_survey_2016_national_summary_tables": "The \"National Ambulatory Medical Care Survey: 2016 National Summary Tables\" is a report published by the CDC. It provides comprehensive data and statistics on ambulatory medical care services in the United States for the year 2016.|Here is another description: The National Ambulatory Medical Care Survey: 2016 National Summary Tables is a comprehensive report detailing the findings and data collected from the 2016 survey conducted by the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC). It provides insights into various aspects of ambulatory medical care in the United States.|Here is another description: The National Ambulatory Medical Care Survey: 2016 National Summary Tables is a technical report that provides comprehensive data on ambulatory care visits in the United States for the year 2016.|Here is another description: The National Ambulatory Medical Care Survey: 2016 National Summary Tables is a technical report that provides comprehensive data on ambulatory care visits in the United States for the year 2016. It is a valuable resource for understanding trends and patterns in outpatient care."},
