{"tech_rep": "A Tech. Rep., short for Technical Report, is a document that presents detailed information, findings, and data from a specific study or survey. In this case, it refers to the technical report format used by the CDC to publish the results of the National Ambulatory Medical Care Survey for the year 2016."},
