{"class_specific_aucs_onto_subclasses_and_individual_diagnostic_statements": "Class-specific AUCs onto subclasses and individual diagnostic statements represent the detailed breakdown of Area Under the Curve (AUC) metrics for specific classes. This decomposition helps in identifying hidden stratifications or performance issues within certain diagnostic subpopulations that may not be apparent when looking at the overall performance of a superclass."},
