{"the_test_set_in_parentheses": "The test set in parentheses represents a subset of the overall dataset that is used to evaluate the performance of a model. In this context, it includes the number of occurrences for each diagnostic label, which is shown in parentheses to provide additional insight into the distribution of labels within the test set."},
{"transparency_of_each_colored_node": "The transparency of each colored node refers to the visual representation of data points in a hierarchical decomposition, where the transparency level of each node is adjusted based on certain criteria."},
