{"weak_classification_performance_on_ivcd": "The object \"weak classification performance on _IVCD_\" describes the specific issue the analysis is trying to address\u2014namely, the relatively poor performance of the classification model when dealing with _IVCD_, especially in combination with _NORM_, as evidenced by lower AUC values in certain clusters."},
