{"finetuning_a_classifier_pretrained_on_ptb_xl_on_a_different_target_dataset": "Finetuning a classifier pretrained on PTB-XL on a different target dataset involves taking a model that has already been trained on the PTB-XL dataset and further training it on a new dataset. This process allows the model to adapt to the specific characteristics of the new dataset, often resulting in improved performance, especially when the new dataset is small or has limited variability."},
